  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 32 * 6 * 12 * 67 * 2 = 81\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) +, ×, −, ÷\n\n32 * 6 * 12 * 67 * 2 = 81 ⇒ 32 + 6 × 12 - 67 ÷ 2 = 81\n\n⇒ 32 + 6 × 12 - __**67 **____**÷**____** 2**__ = 81\n\n⇒ 32 + __**6 **____**×**____** 12**__ - 33.5 = 81\n\n⇒ __**32 + 7**____2__ - 33.5 = 81\n\n⇒ __**104**____** - 33.5**__ = 81\n\n⇒ 70.5 ≠ 81 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷, −, ×, +\n\n32 * 6 * 12 * 67 * 2 = 81 ⇒ 32 ÷ 6 - 12 × 67 + 2 = 81\n\n⇒ __**32 **____**÷**____** 6**__ - 12 × 67 + 2 = 81\n\n⇒ 5.33 - __**12 **____**×**____** 67**__ + 2 = 81\n\n⇒ __**5.33 + 2**__ - 804 = 81\n\n⇒ __7.33____** - 804**__ = 81\n\n⇒ -796.67 ≠ 81 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) −, ×, ÷, − \n\n32 * 6 * 12 * 67 * 2 = 81 ⇒ 32 - 6 × 12 ÷ 67 - 2 = 81\n\n⇒ 32 - 6 × __12 ____÷____ 67__ - 2 = 81\n\n⇒ 32 - __6 ____× 0.17__ - 2 = 81\n\n⇒ __32 - ____1.02____ - 2__ = 81\n\n⇒ 28.98 ≠ 81 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) ×, ÷, +, − \n\n32 * 6 * 12 * 67 * 2 = 81 ⇒ 32 × 6 ÷ 12 + 67 - 2 = 81\n\n⇒ 32 × __**6 ÷ 12**__ + 67 - 2 = 81\n\n⇒ __**32 × 0.5**__ + 67 - 2 = 81\n\n⇒ __16____** + 67**__ - 2 = 81\n\n⇒ **__83__**__** - 2**__ = 81\n\n**⇒ 81 = 81 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
